🔹 Challenge
Asynchronous execution
Batch Job executes outside main thread
Records processed in batches + steps
✅ Strategy
Use munit:enable-flow-source
Mock batch step processors
Use verify-call for step validation
Validate:
Total records processed
Step invocation
✅ Example Mule Flow



XML
<batch:job name="BatchJob">
    <batch:process-records>
        <batch:step name="Step1">
